WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.820
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:08.470
<i>The announcement day of the theme for the 3rd place match has finally arrived.</i>

00:00:11.330 --> 00:00:13.950
This is our true strength.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:21.320
We'll win the finals with ease, and have you lament the fact that we're the best!

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:23.140
Right, Makoto-kun?

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:27.240
He got embarrassed!

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.800
<i>Just you watch, Amano Ichigo.</i>

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:38.290
The shared theme for the finals and third place match, in short...

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:39.870
...is Bonds.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:40.840
Eh?

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.970
It's not Zipang?

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:47.840
The subject is "freedom", and the matches shall be simultaneously held five days from now.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:53.890
I will look forward to the sweets which give feelings of "bonds" that everyone will make.

00:00:54.720 --> 00:00:56.580
"Bonds"..?

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.020
