Get them in our dreams<i>!</i>

00:02:22.670 --> 00:02:26.910
Presented by Wasurenai-subs

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:34.380
Good morning. Yumeiro Pâtissière is brought to you by Konami and these other sponsors.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:51.940
Hey, Ichigo... Why have you been sighing to yourself all this time?

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:54.300
Eh? Ah... nothing.

00:02:54.300 --> 00:02:56.210
It's so obvious!

00:02:56.530 --> 00:02:59.610
If you have troubles, then talk to me about them!

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:04.100
R-Really? Then, um...

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.070
What does "bonds" mean?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:11.970
<i>That's</i> what's troubling you!?

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:15.110
I'm utterly appalled!

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:17.000
You didn't know what the meaning of "bonds" was?

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.710
Even an elementary student knows that!

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.580
Y-You didn't have to say it <i>that</i> harshly...

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:27.350
I don't know something that I don't know.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.890
Tell me~!

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:35.850
recipe 29

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:35.850
Bonds and Mille crêpe

00:03:37.320 --> 00:03:42.400
Bonds are... simply put, a connection between people.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.390
A connection between people?

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:52.380
Yes. Bonds of friendship, bonds of family, bonds of love... there's many different perceptions.

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:56.280
I see! So, if we can challenge using any one of them...

00:03:56.280 --> 00:04:00.990
Haven't all of those been used as themes up until now?

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.210
Oh, I see.

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:10.810
Friends and family... This also means that we need to find an even stronger perception of "bonds" than love itself.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:14.570
I can't imagine anything.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:16.980
Hmm...

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.990
A-group! What are you doing?

00:04:19.430 --> 00:04:21.830
Your hands haven't been moving for awhile now.

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:23.080
Ameya-sensei!

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:23.840
Crap!

00:04:25.630 --> 00:04:28.720
Due to all your whispering, your assignments shall be marked as late.

00:04:28.720 --> 00:04:31.080
A-group, minus 20 points.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.180
Eh!?

00:04:34.080 --> 00:04:37.530
Umm... Sensei, we weren't really whispering...

00:04:37.860 --> 00:04:40.200
We were discussing the Grand Prix...

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:42.090
Hey, Ichigo-chan...

00:04:42.500 --> 00:04:47.110
We are holding lessons at the moment. It is an inappropriate time to discuss the Grand Prix.

00:04:48.160 --> 00:04:51.320
The four of you, come to my office after school.

00:04:51.320 --> 00:04:52.510
Yes...

00:04:53.330 --> 00:04:55.150
We apologise.

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:57.710
Lift your heads.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:02.060
I understand that you're worried about the Grand Prix.

00:05:02.060 --> 00:05:06.380
However, if that's why you can't concentrate during lessons, then you'd be getting your priorities backwards.

00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:06.990
Yes.

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:10.950
So, what exactly about the Grand Prix were you discussing?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:17.220
The theme of the match this time is "bonds". We were discussing what kind of sweets would be appropriate...

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:21.290
We want to come up with a good idea and win the final selection!

00:05:21.890 --> 00:05:23.790
I wonder about that.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:29.270
You can't even concentrate in class... how will you be able to concentrate in the match?

00:05:29.270 --> 00:05:33.180
At this rate, you might not even win a relatively easy match.

00:05:35.930 --> 00:05:38.970
Well... How about trying to forget all this just this once?

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.470
Forget..?

00:05:41.080 --> 00:05:43.850
Eh!? Ichigo, are you serious?

00:05:43.850 --> 00:05:48.130
Yeah. From today until the day of the match, we're going to forget about the Grand Prix.

00:05:48.130 --> 00:05:52.940
What do you mean by that? Has your head gone bonkers or something?

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:54.640
She was bonkers from the very beginning.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:57.770
We're forbidden to talk about the Grand Prix in school.

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:02.690
We're also forbidden to practice after lessons.
That's what she said, anyways.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.680
So then, doesn't that mean that we won't be able to prepare ourselves?

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.380
At the very least, we'll think of ideas by ourselves.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:13.010
And you'll just waltz right into the match without any practice!?

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:15.350
That's going to be a problem...

00:06:16.260 --> 00:06:20.870
Still... I kind of understand the advice that our sensei gave us.

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:28.950
Ever since the Grand Prix started, we've always been thinking of the matches and doing our best so that we can go to Paris, right?

00:06:29.550 --> 00:06:34.240
Because of that, before we knew it, we couldn't see our surroundings, just like today.

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:38.870
So, letting it rest for a while might be good.

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:42.630
If the team leader says so, then we should follow.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:43.370
Yeah.

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:49.380
I think that now's the time we need to put in the most effort, though.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:51.230
Kashino?

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:56.590
Hmm... "bonds"...

00:06:56.600 --> 00:07:01.270
Bonds

00:06:57.380 --> 00:07:01.050
"Bonds"... What can I think of...

00:07:01.800 --> 00:07:03.550
How about the bonds between the four of you?

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:06.290
That'd be close to the theme of "friendship".

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.370
Then, what about sisterly bonds?

00:07:08.370 --> 00:07:11.320
That's also close to "family"...

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:12.410
The bond between us!

00:07:12.410 --> 00:07:14.910
You mean between Vanilla and I?

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:17.720
That's right. It's a <i>really</i> strong bond!

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:21.010
And just <i>how</i> would I explain your small stature?

00:07:21.780 --> 00:07:22.910
Ah, right...

00:07:22.910 --> 00:07:27.230
Ah... Figures, I still can't think of anything!

00:07:27.450 --> 00:07:28.810
Hey, Ichigo.

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:29.550
Hmm?

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:33.460
Are you really not going to practice and just go straight into the match?

00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:37.180
Kashino, for example, gives me a feeling that he's not satisfied.

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:43.460
It'll be okay... since everyone's done their... best to get this far...

00:07:45.740 --> 00:07:49.300
Oh my! As I thought, even she can't fight fatigue.

00:07:50.350 --> 00:07:55.160
Since sensei said that too, it can't be wrong.

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:04.950
Starting from today's self-study session, we shall be revising fundamental food preparation.

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
Most Important Tools

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
・ Crêpe Pan

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
・ Ladle

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
・ Cake Cooler

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
・ Palette Knife

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
・ Whipper

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
・ Chinoise

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:08.670
Etc

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:07.030
This time, we'll be making...

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.660
Mille crêpe.

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.850
Huh? Mille crêpe?

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:16.140
Ameya-sensei, we've done mille crêpe before though...

00:08:16.140 --> 00:08:17.100
That's right.

00:08:17.740 --> 00:08:21.250
If I remember correctly, it was when I first came to the academy...

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:27.390
The batter didn't turn out so well, though.

00:08:27.390 --> 00:08:29.260
I'm different now!

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:37.950
Be quiet! It is important for us to restart from the basics so that we can improve on our skills.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:39.990
Why now?

00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:45.950
We are making fresh cream today.
Pay attention to the temperature.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:49.000
Also, adjust your speed so that you don't whip it too fast.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.590
Today we're doing decoration presentations.

00:09:03.590 --> 00:09:07.270
Please try making marzipan and using it with a chocolate base.

00:09:17.740 --> 00:09:19.280
Happy Birthday

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:33.840
Today's lesson was a total shock, wasn't it?

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.220
Each one we did were the ones we made when we were first-years.

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:41.800
It was my first time, so it was refreshing!

00:09:41.800 --> 00:09:43.210
It was really fun!

00:09:43.210 --> 00:09:47.770
Tomorrow is the match for third place.
Is it really fine to just do these things?

00:09:48.020 --> 00:09:49.310
Now, now.

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:53.730
Well, everyone? Have you figured out an idea for tomorrow?

00:09:53.730 --> 00:09:58.200
I did think about it for awhile yesterday. No luck.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:09:59.510
Same here.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:00.780
Both of you, too?

00:10:00.780 --> 00:10:04.340
"Both of you, too"... does that include you as well, Andou-kun?

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:06.080
It was no use.

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.450
That's what I said.

00:10:08.350 --> 00:10:11.540
It would've been better if we hadn't listened to our sensei's advice.

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:15.420
But we had decided that we'd forget all about the Grand Prix!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.260
We only have one night left!

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:20.520
Even if we have to pull an all-nighter, we have to find an idea, or else!

00:10:20.520 --> 00:10:22.290
While we're at it, let's start preparing!

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.600
Hey, Kashino!

00:10:24.190 --> 00:10:25.380
Wait!

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:34.600
Sadly, no one seems to have noticed what they were doing during lessons.

00:10:35.250 --> 00:10:39.940
Even though Ameya-sensei prepared those lessons just to let them remember...

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:44.960
Since it's come to this, it's up to us to make them remember!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.920
Pets

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.920
Family

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.920
Parents ・ Siblings

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:55.920
Bonds

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.200
Next!

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:59.510
Umm... The bonds towards tomorrow?

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:01.520
And <i>how</i> are you going to present that? Next!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:05.420
A candy sculpture based on the image of the bonds of roses.

00:11:05.420 --> 00:11:07.060
What the hell are "bonds of roses"!?

00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:10.940
Is it really okay to ignore sensei's advice?

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:15.660
It's fine. Anyway, it'll be bad if we haven't
decided on what to make yet, right?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.560
Hey! A-group!

00:11:19.020 --> 00:11:21.440
What are you doing here?

00:11:24.680 --> 00:11:28.160
You sure have guts to ignore sensei's advice.

00:11:28.810 --> 00:11:32.000
Caramel, what's up with that outfit?

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:35.490
Wrong! I'm not Caramel!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:37.670
I'm Ameya-sensei.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:43.650
We'll show something good to all you forgetful ones.

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:47.510
Vanilla!

00:11:50.610 --> 00:11:55.190
I can't do it! I've never made mille crêpe before!

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.900
Amano-san! Are you kidding me!?

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:02.080
A-group, minus 10 points!

00:12:03.580 --> 00:12:06.370
Amano's failure when she first transferred, huh?

00:12:07.000 --> 00:12:08.680
H-Hey..!

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:09.690
Next is Cafe!

00:12:11.390 --> 00:12:14.200
Happy Birthday, baby!

00:12:14.870 --> 00:12:18.370
Hanabusa-kun, we're practicing with <i>hiragana</i> today.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:22.340
Don't mind me, I prefer doing it this way.

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:24.720
That's <i>not</i> the issue here!

00:12:24.720 --> 00:12:26.720
A kid can't read this!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:30.050
Now it's my turn!

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:33.060
All right! This design is perfect.

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:36.840
Kashino-kun! We're not doing chocolate sculptures!

00:12:36.840 --> 00:12:40.070
You can't make such detailed things with marzipan!

00:12:41.450 --> 00:12:43.610
Now, the last one is..!

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:48.950
I wonder how the cream will turn out if I heat it like red bean paste...

00:12:48.950 --> 00:12:53.080
What are you doing, Andou-kun!? The cream will decompose!

00:12:55.220 --> 00:12:57.590
How's that? Anything come to mind?

00:12:57.590 --> 00:12:59.840
Nothing comes to mind...

00:12:59.840 --> 00:13:02.330
That just now, it was about...

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.090
The times we were scolded by Ameya-sensei, right?

00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:08.400
We have always been watching you.

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.830
What are you all doing?

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:15.520
Ahh! It's the real one!

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.020
Eh?

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.020
Umm... we're sorry!

00:13:20.460 --> 00:13:23.390
We ignored sensei's advice...

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:27.270
It's fine. It seems that everyone remembered, after all.

00:13:27.270 --> 00:13:29.340
O-Of course.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.900
Why did you make us have the same lessons we've failed before?

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:37.770
"Forget about the Grand Prix" is what I said before, right?

00:13:37.770 --> 00:13:38.380
Yes.

00:13:38.950 --> 00:13:42.610
To tell you the truth, I've actually participated in the Grand Prix in the past.

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:44.090
Ameya-sensei did?

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:54.300
I was in my first year of high school. Even though it was my first try, we somehow got past the semifinals, but...

00:13:54.930 --> 00:13:59.600
I was under a lot of pressure, so I wasn't able to concentrate during lessons.

00:14:00.510 --> 00:14:04.720
Yet at the finals, even though it was something I should have learned during lessons...

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:07.010
...I just wasn't able to do tempering anymore.

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:15.540
If I had listened during lessons and practiced, maybe I wouldn't have failed back then. I regret it.

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:19.710
That's just like us that time when we were scolded by sensei...

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:22.450
That's why I wanted you to understand this.

00:14:22.450 --> 00:14:26.340
Winning the Grand Prix and going to Paris isn't everything.

00:14:27.560 --> 00:14:32.090
The most important things are being able to fully grasp what you've learned during lessons,

00:14:32.090 --> 00:14:36.510
overcoming your weaknesses, and improving yourself.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:41.720
If you do that, then no matter what the situation, even if it's the Grand Prix finals...

00:14:41.720 --> 00:14:44.110
...I'm sure you'll be able to clear it with a calm heart.

00:14:44.110 --> 00:14:46.150
Ameya-sensei!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:49.110
So you were thinking of us that much...

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:53.370
Well, unexpectedly, it seems that Amano-san hasn't really made any progress yet.

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:58.520
Th-That was on purpose. On purpose!

00:14:58.940 --> 00:15:02.280
I just wanted to remember about my past self.

00:15:02.550 --> 00:15:05.680
Your past self? Don't you mean your <i>current</i> self?

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:09.720
That's not true! You've been watching me, haven't you?

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.880
I've really improved!

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:19.110
<i>Everyone, thank you for telling us about our lessons.</i>

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:25.480
<i>I see. If it's something like this, then I think I have an idea of what "bonds" is.</i>

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:28.140
I got it, everyone!

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:31.090
I know what we'll be making for the theme "Bonds"!

00:15:31.090 --> 00:15:32.700
So, what are you going to do?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.200
It's a secret from sensei!

00:15:41.180 --> 00:15:43.760
We'll follow exactly what we discussed yesterday, right?

00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.750
Yeah. Let's all do our best!

00:15:46.190 --> 00:15:49.770
This is the match for third place, after all. I'm all fired up!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:50.590
Okay.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:55.430
Sensei, what are Ichigo-chan and the others going to make?

00:15:55.430 --> 00:15:57.310
Who knows... I wonder what they'll do.

00:16:00.850 --> 00:16:03.250
Caramel doesn't know what it is!

00:16:03.250 --> 00:16:09.400
Me neither. I've asked Kashino countless
times, but he said that it's top secret.

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.950
Still, it seems like they were working hard on it yesterday.

00:16:21.020 --> 00:16:22.790
I wonder what they'll make.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:28.380
<i>Calm heart. Calm heart.</i>

00:16:33.060 --> 00:16:36.250
That's exactly what we were doing yesterday!

00:16:36.250 --> 00:16:39.760
They're making mille crêpe for the match for third place!?

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.260
All four of them are making marzipan!

00:17:01.790 --> 00:17:02.640
Okay!

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.300
It's done.

00:17:03.300 --> 00:17:04.150
Me too.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:06.530
<i>Just a little more, a little more!</i>

00:17:06.530 --> 00:17:08.630
Ichigo, do your best!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.510
Done!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.300
Please stop.

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:28.520
Oh, Team Kobayakawa has done quite an original work, haven't they?

00:17:28.700 --> 00:17:32.380
The four of us worked together on the cake base, and the other parts are finished with...

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:38.490
...macaron, savarin, choux, and truffle, each of which are our own specialties.

00:17:38.490 --> 00:17:41.980
A cake that cannot be completed without the abilities of all four of us.

00:17:41.980 --> 00:17:45.080
It's a decoration cake based on the bonds of a team.

00:17:45.380 --> 00:17:53.220
I see. It's the fruition of the bonds between the four of you that has enabled you all to come this far, is that right?

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:56.540
And this is?

00:17:57.640 --> 00:17:59.970
It seems rather cute.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:02.900
I can't see it clearly...

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.720
What's the shape of the marzipan?

00:18:04.720 --> 00:18:07.610
It's too small, so I'm not sure.

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:09.520
Let's move a little closer.

00:18:11.790 --> 00:18:15.130
This cake is everyone's bonds.

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.660
Oh, their bonds, is it?

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:26.080
I made the mille crêpe, Andou-kun the fresh cream, Hanabusa-kun the chocolate plate, and Kashino-kun the marzipan.

00:18:26.700 --> 00:18:31.170
We remembered how to make these pastries because we got scolded by Ameya-sensei about them once.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.540
Amano-san...

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:38.720
Being able to stand here isn't just because of the powers of the four of us.

00:18:39.350 --> 00:18:42.720
We also have many bonds among the people surrounding us.

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:49.270
It's especially thanks to our homeroom teacher, Ameya-sensei, who has guided and helped us along the way.

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:53.790
Team Ichigo, filled with feelings of gratitude for those people...

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:58.110
...made this mille crêpe based on the bonds between everyone.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:00.150
Everyone...

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:08.440
I see. I understand clearly now.

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:13.110
By the way, the four girls that are made with marzipan...

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:16.960
They seem to differ from the four of you, don't they?

00:19:17.540 --> 00:19:22.510
These are the ones that are always cheering us on. They are our important friends!

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.060
Why did you make this a surprise?

00:19:29.870 --> 00:19:33.770
If it was something like that, then I'll forgive you for keeping it a secret.

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:37.120
I am a <i>guy</i>, you know!

00:19:37.120 --> 00:19:39.620
Don't mind the small details!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:42.820
Now's our chance!

00:19:44.250 --> 00:19:45.580
Magical macaron.

00:19:45.580 --> 00:19:47.590
Sweets Romance Card.

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.830
Come out!

00:19:55.740 --> 00:20:00.370
Well then, we shall now announce the results of the teams.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:06.180
Total:

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.770
Team Kobayakawa, 30 points.

00:20:09.550 --> 00:20:13.790
Team Ichigo, 37 points.

00:20:13.990 --> 00:20:16.770
Result: Team Ichigo wins.

00:20:16.770 --> 00:20:18.350
Yes!

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:18.350
All right!

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:20.930
Now they're going to join the actual competition for sure!

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:23.690
<i>Make sure that you work hard from now on too...</i>

00:20:23.690 --> 00:20:30.830
<i>...because while you're Team Ichigo,
you're also in second-year A-group as well.</i>

00:20:32.090 --> 00:20:34.440
Oh, Team Ichigo!

00:20:35.190 --> 00:20:37.530
You've somehow managed to win, eh?

00:20:37.530 --> 00:20:38.840
Koshiro-san!

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:42.960
Of course, we too had an epic victory.

00:20:43.210 --> 00:20:46.920
We shall also gracefully advance to the final selections.

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:51.610
Makoto-kun. Next time, you'll be my lovey-dovey fiancé.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:21:00.650
That Ojou, what's she blathering about with that big mouth of hers!?

00:21:01.350 --> 00:21:03.150
Isn't it fine?

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.700
It keeps you on edge.

00:21:04.950 --> 00:21:06.180
It's <i>not</i> funny!

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:08.970
This may be a kind of bond between you and her.

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.820
Bonds are... beautiful.

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:11.240
<i>Henri-sensei,</i>

00:21:09.820 --> 00:21:11.240
IT'S <i>NOT</i> FUNNY!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:15.240
<i>we've finally advanced to the final selections of the Grand Prix!</i>

00:21:15.240 --> 00:21:19.090
<i>I will definitely do my best and go to Paris!</i>

